      "title": "Small Words Around Ikke",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "A subject is who or what the clause is about. An object is the person or thing affected by the verb. A pronoun is a short word such as "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "jeg",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": ", "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "ham",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": ", or "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "det",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": ". A noun phrase is a noun with any words that belong to it, such as "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "den nye læreren",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "After an opening time or place expression, small pronouns often stand before "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "ikke",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": ", while heavier noun phrases often sound natural after "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "ikke",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": ". This is a word-weight pattern, not a new meaning of "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "ikke",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "I dag ser jeg ham ikke."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Today I do not see him."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "I dag ser jeg ikke den nye læreren."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
